@host = http://localhost:5086
@customerToken = PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Home
GET {{host}}/api/site/home

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories/menu

### Provinces
GET {{host}}/api/provinces

### Public advertisements
GET {{host}}/api/advertisements?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10&sort=newest

### Customer login
POST {{host}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "09120000002",
  "password": "Customer@123456",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Simulate membership purchase
POST {{host}}/api/customer/membership/purchase/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Current membership
GET {{host}}/api/customer/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Create draft advertisement - replace IDs after checking categories/provinces/cities
POST {{host}}/api/customer/advertisements
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "آگهی تست از فایل HTTP",
  "description": "این آگهی برای تست API ثبت شده است.",
  "price": 1000000,
  "phoneNumber": "09120000002",
  "advertisementCategoryID": 2,
  "provinceID": 8,
  "cityID": 1,
  "isImmediate": true
}

### Admin login
POST {{host}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "09120000001",
  "password": "Admin@123456",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Payment report
GET {{host}}/api/admin/payments?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
